WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.032
Before looking at a sample solution, explain your design.

00:00:04.032 --> 00:00:07.387
The view should have one row per employee.

00:00:07.387 --> 00:00:12.687
It should expose the columns required for employee and department analysis.

00:00:12.687 --> 00:00:18.042
The report query should rely on that interface rather than rebuilding the join.

00:00:18.042 --> 00:00:23.977
That is how you demonstrate modular design rather than only S Q L syntax.
